"outputs/666700f7-7798-43ce-a8ca-d91e48adda4f-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"That was just a single feature of a single data vector. When encoding $N$ "
"features into the rotation angles of $n$ qubits, say for the $j^\\text{th}$ "
"data vector $\\vec{x}^{(j)} = (x_1,...,x_N),$ the encoded product state will"
" look like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"Aceasta a fost doar o singură trăsătură a unui singur vector de date. Când "
"se codifică $N$ trăsături în unghiurile de rotație ale $n$ qubiți, să spunem"
" pentru al $j$-lea vector de date $\\vec{x}^{(j)} = (x_1,...,x_N),$ starea "
"produs codificată va arăta astfel:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\vec{x}^{(j)}\\rangle = \\bigotimes^N_{k=1} \\cos(\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k)|0\\rangle + \\sin(\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k)|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\vec{x}^{(j)}\\rangle = \\bigotimes^N_{k=1} \\cos(\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k)|0\\rangle + \\sin(\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k)|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We note that this is equivalent to\n"
msgstr "Remarcăm că aceasta este echivalentă cu\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\vec{x}^{(j)}\\rangle = \\bigotimes^N_{k=1} R_Y(2\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k)|0\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\vec{x}^{(j)}\\rangle = \\bigotimes^N_{k=1} R_Y(2\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k)|0\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

