"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathscr{U}_{\\text{ZFM}}(\\bar{x})|00\\rangle = P(\\bar{x})^{\\otimes 2} H^{\\otimes 2}|00\\rangle = \\left( P\\left(\\textstyle\\frac{1}{3}\\pi\\right)H|0\\rangle \\right) \\otimes \\left(P\\left(\\textstyle\\frac{1}{2}\\pi\\right)H|0\\rangle\\right).\n"
"$$\n"

